Modifications
    The data is not shipped verbatim. The importer normalizes it into a
    read-only columnar layout, interns strings into a shared arena, and drops
    tables the decoder does not consult. The stored procedures under
    vpic/procs/ are translations of NHTSA's T-SQL into PostgreSQL plpgsql,
    kept for use as a parity oracle. Decode results are verified against the
    unmodified upstream procedures; see docs/ACCEPTANCE.md.

